==Description==
The '''Reindeer Nametag''' is a nametag that could be obtained at Level 4 of the premium [[Operation I.C.E Event#Operation I.C.E Event Battle Pass|Operation I.C.E Battle Pass]] track. At that Level, it costed {{Bell|100}} or {{Robux|38}} to unlock it, with a total cost of {{Bell|250}} or {{Robux|140}}.

The '''Reindeer Nametag''' has a dark brown, brown and dark brown gradient text with a black translucent outline. Above the text two brown antlers and under it, there is a glowing red nose.

